    {
      "t": "h3",
      "text": "A pre-flight you can click"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Section 03 is a working readiness gate: blockers can't be waived, and the readiness score only reaches GO when they're cleared."
    },
    {
      "t": "text",
      "tag": "span",
      "cls": "n",
      "text": "03"
